{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A duration is born with the standard its text is written in, and stays in it: 30s is short, PT5M is iso.\n(item-doors 57: a value becomes text only through Output, so the written form is read by interpolating the duration, not by a .text member.\nA type's kind is a type, so its name is %short!type.kind.name%.)",
